ab381d143e0e2a8f71e6cd117dab7b5e5236575fe70213a09b9ce33aa71bf558e860afc9f73574b1524992017a274468f3993fc74f5813065130181649b24149  0001-kcm-wifi-mobile-Toggle-Wi-Fi-only-on-user-click.patch
"
